# Story page: nm-bramble
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Overgrowth
---
Bramblewood remembered every squeeze, every bite, every trampled thorn, and grew back twice as thick.

{name} wove between thorns that sprouted faster than it could slither, until the whole wood was one long scratch.

'A garden is only a wilderness that hasn't won yet,' said the coil. I have since given up gardening.
